{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08557","headline":"江上答崔宣城 · 李白","name":"江上答崔宣城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太华三芙蓉，明星玉女峰。\n寻仙下西岳，陶令忽相逢。\n问我将何事，湍波历几重。\n貂裘非季子，鹤氅似王恭。\n谬忝燕台召，而陪郭隗踪。\n水流知入海，云去或从龙。\n树绕芦洲月，山鸣鹊镇钟。\n还期如可访，台岭荫长松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}